   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2026-09-26T15:48:52-05:00",
   "body": "Relatively [b]low[/b] drop rate.\n\nI collected my [b]Isosprings[/b] very quickly grinding the level [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=480/rusty-harvest-golem#map]9-10 versions[/url]. In the end I even had a few left over, and I was able to sell them in the Auction House for a little profit.\n\n[b]Gyrostabilizers[/b] also drop from [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=36/harvest-golem#map]Harvest Golems[/url] and from the level 17-18 [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=115/harvest-reaper#map]reapers[/url]. These may be a good location to grind for them, as these mobs aren't involved in other quests making it a quieter area competition-wise.\n\nIt probably goes without saying, but this quest is best combined with [quest=9]. You may also complete [quest=103] and part of [quest=38] grinding the same mobs.",
